gacD(){return"Without signing in, you can still use every feature of the app \u2014 everything is stored on your device.\n\nWhen you sign in, the app uploads the following to a server (Supabase) so you can use it on other devices and after reinstalling the app:\n\u2022 Saved places (name and location).\n\u2022 Trip history: origin, destination (locations rounded to ~100 m), departure time, routes, distance, fare. You can turn this off separately after signing in.\n\nYour current location and search history never leave your device. You can delete your account together with all its data on the server right in the app."},
