gacp(){return"T\xd4I \u0110I l\xe0 \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng \u0111\u1ed9c l\u1eadp, KH\xd4NG ph\u1ea3i \u1ee9ng d\u1ee5ng ch\xednh th\u1ee9c v\xe0 kh\xf4ng \u0111\u1ea1i di\u1ec7n cho Trung t\xe2m Qu\u1ea3n l\xfd Giao th\xf4ng c\xf4ng c\u1ed9ng TP.HCM, T\u1ed5ng c\xf4ng ty V\u1eadn t\u1ea3i H\xe0 N\u1ed9i (Transerco) hay b\u1ea5t k\u1ef3 c\u01a1 quan nh\xe0 n\u01b0\u1edbc n\xe0o."},
